}","line_end":235,"line_start":221,"recommendation":"Handle `denom == 0` explicitly: if `borrows > 0` and `assets == reserves`, return `SCALE_1E6` (100% utilization) instead of 0, or revert so the caller can fall back to a safe static rate.","repo":"https://github.com/PeridotFinance/Peridot-Soroban","severity":"LOW","sha":"95c6e39bd1095d43cd4240b8ce7d8d1d82044aba","state":"OPEN","title":"Zero utilization returned when reserves equal assets"},{"category":"","description":"In test/debug (or when the `test-default-admin` feature is enabled), `expected_admin_config()` falls back to `DEFAULT_INIT_ADMIN` if `JUMP_RATE_MODEL_INIT_ADMIN` is unset. If this build configuration is mistakenly deployed to production, the contract’s initialization admin becomes a publicly known hardcoded address, creating a deployment-takeover (if the key is controlled) or permanent misconfiguration/DoS (if not).

